{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7uw521d8","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":17,"title":"Ich war schon in Berlin","nativeTitle":"I Have Already Been to Berlin","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Nawin","Gast","Nico","Sebastian","Nina"],"speakerGenders":{"Nawin":"male","Nico":"male","Sebastian":"male","Nina":"female"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Nawin","target":"Hey! Schön, dass ihr da seid!","native":"Hey! Nice that you're here!"},{"speaker":"Gast","target":"Hallo, Nawin, schön, dich zu sehen! Vielen Dank für die Einladung!","native":"Hello, Nawin, nice to see you! Thank you very much for the invitation!"},{"speaker":"Nawin","target":"Cool, danke schön!","native":"Cool, thank you very much!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Prost!","native":"Cheers!"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Prost!","native":"Cheers!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Was ist das?","native":"What is that?"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Das? Das ist eine Sehenswürdigkeit in Köln: der Kölner Dom . Warst du schon mal in Köln? Kennst du die Stadt ?","native":"That? That's a sight in Cologne: Cologne Cathedral. Have you ever been to Cologne? Do you know the city?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Nein.","native":"No."},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Warst du noch nie in Deutschland? Oder in Österreich oder in der Schweiz ?","native":"Have you never been to Germany? Or to Austria or Switzerland?"},{"speaker":"Nawin","target":"Jetzt habe ich Geschenke aus Köln, Hamburg, Düsseldorf, Heidelberg und Berlin.","native":"Now I have gifts from Cologne, Hamburg, Düsseldorf, Heidelberg and Berlin."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Und welche Städte kennst du schon?","native":"And which cities do you already know?"},{"speaker":"Nawin","target":"Ich war schon mal in Hamburg und in Köln. In Heidelberg war ich noch nie. Nächste Woche fahre ich nach München!","native":"I've been to Hamburg and Cologne before. I've never been to Heidelberg. Next week I'm going to Munich!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Was ist das?","native":"What is that?"},{"speaker":"Nawin","target":"Das ist das Brandenburger Tor . Eine Sehenswürdigkeit in Berlin.","native":"That's the Brandenburg Gate. A sight in Berlin."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Kennst du Berlin?","native":"Do you know Berlin?"},{"speaker":"Nawin","target":"Nein. Aber Nina war schon mal in Berlin. Und Sebastian. Ihr wart schon mal in Berlin, oder?","native":"No. But Nina has been to Berlin before. And Sebastian. You've both been to Berlin, right?"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Wir beide waren schon mal in Berlin, ja. Wir waren sogar am Brandenburger Tor.","native":"Yes, we've both been to Berlin. We were even at the Brandenburg Gate."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Nico?","native":"Nico?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Hm …","native":"Hm …"},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Alles gut? Kein Kommentar? Komm! Wir spielen ein Spiel .","native":"Everything okay? No comment? Come on! We're playing a game."}],"teach":null,"wordData":null,"progress":{"teach":false,"full":false,"practice":null},"createdAt":1795063529480,"updatedAt":1795063529520},"course":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","name":"Nicos Weg","level":"","from":"","to":"German","createdAt":1795063529520,"custom":true},"pack":{"v":1,"lines":{"0":{"f":"Hey! Schön, dass ihr da seid!","fn":"Hey! Nice that you're here!"},"1":{"f":"Hallo, Nawin, schön, dich zu sehen! Vielen Dank für die Einladung!","fn":"Hello, Nawin, nice to see you! Thank you very much for the invitation!"},"2":{"f":"Cool, danke schön!","fn":"Cool, thank you very much!"},"3":{"f":"Prost!","fn":"Cheers!"},"4":{"f":"Prost!","fn":"Cheers!"},"5":{"f":"Was ist das?","fn":"What is that?"},"6":{"f":"Das? Das ist eine Sehenswürdigkeit in Köln: der Kölner Dom . Warst du schon mal in Köln? Kennst du die Stadt ?","fn":"That? That's a sight in Cologne: Cologne Cathedral. Have you ever been to Cologne? Do you know the city?"},"7":{"f":"Nein.","fn":"No."},"8":{"f":"Warst d